        "created_at": "2015-12-22T04:16:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm not sure he would gain health from Ongoing or Equipment cards due to Imbued Vitality as they would have to be in play for them to be a target. &nbsp; Going immediately to the trash they wouldn't be considered a target as they have no innate health. &nbsp;</p>",
